      <description>&lt;p&gt;Recovery isn&amp;#39;t just about stopping a habit—it&amp;#39;s about learning how to navigate life 🧠✨.&lt;br /&gt;From supportive counseling to classes like Dialectical Behavior Therapy (DBT), a strong support system helps you separate what you can control from what you can’t. &lt;br /&gt;Surround yourself with community and stay connected to keep moving forward on the right path!   &lt;a href="https://mastodon.social/tags/MentalHealthAwareness" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;MentalHealthAwareness&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://mastodon.social/tags/DBT" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;DBT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://mastodon.social/tags/SupportSystems" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;SupportSystems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://mastodon.social/tags/PersonalGrowth" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;PersonalGrowth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://mastodon.social/tags/RecoveryIsPossible" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;RecoveryIsPossible&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://mastodon.social/tags/SelfCare" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;SelfCare&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://mastodon.social/tags/MindsetShift" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;MindsetShift&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
